-- Q3693: Incident Response and Recovery [medium/L2]
-- Issues: #1, #3
UPDATE questions SET
  choices = $EXPL$["No classification is needed since the vendor deleted the email without opening it","A data breach requiring notification analysis due to PII leaving organizational control","A minor policy violation requiring only an internal HR reprimand of the sender","A near-miss event requiring only awareness training documentation and no formal response"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Per NIST SP 800-61 Rev. 2, unauthorized disclosure of PII constitutes a reportable event regardless of whether the recipient accessed the data. The transmission of 450 SSNs outside organizational control triggers breach notification analysis under most state laws.
