Wrong (C): While the employee may face HR consequences, the incident requires formal breach classification and notification analysis, not just a reprimand.
Wrong (D): An incident involving 450 SSNs sent externally is not a near-miss; it is an actual unauthorized disclosure requiring formal response.$EXPL$
