  choices = $EXPL$["Both MTTD and MTTR are within industry best-practice benchmarks","Both metrics are excessive, giving attackers a 75-day window for lateral movement","Only the 30-day MTTR is concerning; the 45-day MTTD is acceptable","These metrics are not meaningful indicators for security program assessment"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
